api	api	image	-
web	web	image	-

=== service inspect :: $ ployz service inspect web
Service web (a085f2f9-e4df-439e-9d34-99e5b3ee7405)
Private DNS: web
Source: image
env={"GREETING":"hello"}
image="alpine:3.23.3"
maxRetries=10
privateDns="web"
replicas=2
restartPolicy="unless-stopped"
startCommand="sh -c 'echo started; while true; do echo tick; sleep 2; done'"

